.TH pthread_cancel 3 2025\-09\-21 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
pthread_cancel \- スレッドにキャンセル要求を送る
.SH ライブラリ
POSIX スレッドライブラリ (\fIlibpthread\fP,\~\fI\-lpthread\fP)
.SH 書式
.nf
\fB#include <pthread.h>\fP
.P
\fBint pthread_cancel(pthread_t \fP\fIthread\fP\fB);\fP
.fi
.SH 説明
The \fBpthread_cancel\fP()  function sends a cancelation request to the thread
\fIthread\fP.  Whether and when the target thread reacts to the cancelation
request depends on two attributes that are under the control of that thread:
its cancelability \fIstate\fP and \fItype\fP.
.P
A thread's cancelability state, determined by \fBpthread_setcancelstate\fP(3),
can be \fIenabled\fP (the default for new threads) or \fIdisabled\fP.  If a thread
has disabled cancelation, then a cancelation request remains queued until
the thread enables cancelation.  If a thread has enabled cancelation, then
its cancelability type determines when cancelation occurs.
.P
A thread's cancelation type, determined by \fBpthread_setcanceltype\fP(3), may
be either \fIasynchronous\fP or \fIdeferred\fP (the default for new threads).
Asynchronous cancelability means that the thread can be canceled at any time
(usually immediately, but the system does not guarantee this).  Deferred
cancelability means that cancelation will be delayed until the thread next
calls a function that is a \fIcancelation point\fP.  A list of functions that
are or may be cancelation points is provided in \fBpthreads\fP(7).
.P
When a cancelation request is acted on, the following steps occur for
\fIthread\fP (in this order):
.IP (1) 5
Cancelation clean\-up handlers are popped (in the reverse of the order in
which they were pushed) and called.  (See \fBpthread_cleanup_push\fP(3).)
.IP (2)
スレッド固有データのデストラクタ (destructor) が呼び出される。
呼び出し順序は規定されていない。
(\fBpthread_key_create\fP(3) 参照)
.IP (3)
スレッドが終了される。 (\fBpthread_exit\fP(3) 参照)
.P
The above steps happen asynchronously with respect to the
\fBpthread_cancel\fP()  call; the return status of \fBpthread_cancel\fP()  merely
informs the caller whether the cancelation request was successfully queued.
.P
After a canceled thread has terminated, a join with that thread using
\fBpthread_join\fP(3)  obtains \fBPTHREAD_CANCELED\fP as the thread's exit
status.  (Joining with a thread is the only way to know that cancelation has
completed.)
.SH 返り値
成功すると、 \fBpthread_cancel\fP() は 0 を返す。
エラーの場合、0 以外のエラー番号を返す。
.SH エラー
.TP 
\fBESRCH\fP
ID が \fIthread\fP のスレッドが見つからなかった。
.SH 属性
この節で使用されている用語の説明については、 \fBattributes\fP(7) を参照。
.TS
allbox;
lbx lb lb
l l l.
インターフェース	属性	値
